{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8667bff08406b7b7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tstrat_id: RHAISTRAT-9019\n3\ttitle: Curated getting-started tutorial gallery\n4\tstatus: Refinement Done\n5\tpriority: Major\n6\tlabels:\n7\t- refined\n8\t- onboarding\n9\tlinks: []\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t## Problem Statement\n13\t\n14\tNew users face a blank platform: the first workbench, first pipeline, and first\n15\tmodel deployment all start from empty forms, and time-to-first-success is\n16\tmeasured in days. We want a curated tutorial gallery in the Dashboard — a set\n17\tof maintained, tested tutorials (notebooks and pipelines) that users can launch\n18\tinto their own project with one click. This requires product code (the gallery\n19\tand launch mechanics), authored content (the tutorials themselves), and\n20\tdocumentation — three different kinds of work with different owners and review\n21\tprocesses.\n22\t\n23\t## High-Level Requirements\n24\t\n25\t| ID | Priority | Requirement |\n26\t|-------|----------|-------------|\n27\t| HLR-1 | P0 | The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook, or importing the pipeline). |\n28\t| HLR-2 | P0 | Six curated tutorials exist covering the core journeys: first workbench, data prep, first training run, first pipeline, first deployment, first RAG app. Each is tested against the current release. |\n29\t| HLR-3 | P1 | A tutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest) is defined so tutorials are versioned and testable independently of Dashboard releases. |\n30\t| HLR-4 | P2 | Documentation covers using the gallery and the contribution process for new tutorials. |\n31\t\n32\t## Affected Components\n33\t\n34\t- Dashboard\n35\t- Notebooks\n36\t- Data Science Pipelines\n37\t- Documentation\n38\t\n39\t## Out of Scope\n40\t\n41\t- Partner- or community-contributed tutorial intake (contribution process is\n42\t  documented, but no submission tooling this release)\n43\t- Localization of tutorial content\n44\t\n45\t## Open Questions\n46\t\n47\tNone.\n48\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9126a4174cb3c3e5","agent_id":"a81bb8d060212c78b","session_id":"7d9fc257-6641-4b77-aebe-6dc2ab6f744b","uuid":"db593a58-394b-4286-9d85-c1afdc8ff4db","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:04:14.551Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8667bff08406b7b7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019 into epics"}
