fication is reviewed and agreed by the teams that build against\n  it — the Dashboard gallery implementers and the tutorial authoring teams —\n  before dependent work consumes it.\n- The format specification is committed to an accessible platform repository.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1 — tutorial packaging format). This epic is prioritized P0 by\n  inheritance: the gallery and all curated tutorials build against the format,\n  so it gates the strategy's P0 delivery.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":40138,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9126a4174cb3c3e5","agent_id":"a81bb8d060212c78b","session_id":"7d9fc257-6641-4b77-aebe-6dc2ab6f744b","uuid":"8a1dac67-d975-4984-a51a-a63e54dcf75e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:07:53.891Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019 into epics"}
