lease cycles.\n50\t- Define versioning rules for packaged tutorials.\n51\t- Publish the format specification where the Dashboard gallery implementers and\n52\t  the tutorial authoring teams can build against it.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The packaging format is documented and covers metadata, pinned images, and a\n57\t  validation manifest, as required by the strategy.\n58\t- A tutorial packaged in the format can be versioned and validated independently\n59\t  of a Dashboard release: running its validation manifest against a target\n60\t  release produces a deterministic pass/fail result.\n61\t- The format specification is reviewed and agreed by the teams that build against\n62\t  it — the Dashboard gallery implementers and the tutorial authoring teams —\n63\t  before dependent work consumes it.\n64\t- The format specification is committed to an accessible platform repository.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-3 (P1 — tutorial packaging format). This epic is prioritized P0 by\n69\t  inheritance: the gallery and all curated tutorials build against the format,\n70\t  so it gates the strategy's P0 delivery.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2c680267fccf75d","agent_id":"a3400be638653be5c","session_id":"7d9fc257-6641-4b77-aebe-6dc2ab6f744b","uuid":"02d19043-49e7-4d2f-9e65-1f18304b4e40","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:19:33.096Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bea546d89e58b83f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review of RHAISTRAT-9019"}
