his epic's launch acceptance criteria.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery in the Dashboard and see the curated\n55\t  tutorials listed with their metadata.\n56\t- Launching a notebook tutorial from the gallery creates a workbench in the\n57\t  user's project containing the tutorial notebook, and the workbench reaches a\n58\t  healthy running state (this validates the workbench path end to end).\n59\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial from the gallery imports the pipeline into the\n60\t  user's project, and the imported pipeline is visible and runnable (this\n61\t  validates the pipeline import path end to end).\n62\t- End-to-end launch is verified with at least one tutorial packaged in the\n63\t  defined tutorial packaging format.\n64\t- The gallery can be disabled through the Dashboard's existing configuration\n65\t  surface without affecting other Dashboard functionality, providing a rollback\n66\t  path for the new surface.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-1 (P0 — tutorial gallery with one-click launch into the user's project).\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2c680267fccf75d","agent_id":"a3400be638653be5c","session_id":"7d9fc257-6641-4b77-aebe-6dc2ab6f744b","uuid":"1f8e89aa-0799-43f3-8973-35d9f6ba7ef5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:19:33.740Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ae543afca728d1a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review of RHAISTRAT-9019"}
